<title>POLAND: GORAZDZE UPS STAKE IN MINERAL MINE.</title>
<headline>GORAZDZE UPS STAKE IN MINERAL MINE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish cement plant Gorazdze SA has bought 41.3 percent in a Polish mineral mine from two National Investment Funds (NFIs), increasing its stake in the firm to 74.3 percent, Gorazdze said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it bought 27 percent stake in Zielonogorskie Kopalnie Surowcow Mineralnych SA from NFI No. 8 or Octawa and 14.3-percent from NFI No. 6 or Magna Polonia.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
